{{also|Perkele}}
==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Derives from the name of the Baltic deity of thunder, compare Lithuanian [[Perkūnas]] and Slavic [[Perun]]. The meaning was changed to devil by priests after the introduction of Christianity.

